  dcterms:abstract "Run SPARQL 1.1/1.2 queries (SELECT/ASK/CONSTRUCT/DESCRIBE) and UPDATE against the sparq RDF engine in Rust — load RDF into a sparq_core::Graph, then use sparq_engine::{query, ask, query_json, count, construct, describe, update}; covers property paths, RDF 1.2 triple terms, aggregates/subqueries, custom extension functions (query_with_functions / FunctionRegistry), prepared queries, query budgets/timeouts, named-graph dataset views, and EXPLAIN. Use when an agent or developer needs to embed/execute SPARQL over sparq." ;
  pkg:exploredStatus pkg:Explored ;
